  "chapters": [
    {
      "number": 2,
      "title": "第二章",
      "sections": [
        {
          "number": 8,
          "title": "捕梦于神秘园中",
          "act": "第七幕",
          "notes": [],
          "tasks": [
            {
              "sequence": 33,
              "quest_id": 150000000,
              "title": "捕梦于神秘园中",
              "reading_status": "ordered_draft",
              "notes": [],
              "events": [
                {
                  "sequence": 1,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这里看起来可并不沉静。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 2,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "看来这场混乱席卷了整座试验场……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 3,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "那这里应该也需要调律？",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_3",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_1:2",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 4,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "嗯，调律台就在柱子后面。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 5,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "水好像不深，或许可以走过去。",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_5",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_1:3",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 6,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "水？它们是维持试验场运转的能源。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 7,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "别着急，我先进行调律，看能否驱散浓雾，清出最近的道路。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_7"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 8,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "（主动使用能力，脸色也没有刚才那么差了……她的伤势和共鸣能力，看起来都在慢慢恢复。）",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_8"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 9,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "（我们的合作建立在她受伤的基础上，不知道她完全恢复需要多久……一旦恢复完全，这短暂的同盟恐怕就会立刻结束。）",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_9"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 10,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "如果这样的世界真的无法改变，或许应该寻找新的道路了……即使与以往的办法完全不同。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_10"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 11,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "我会为你实现自己的理想提供一切帮助，因为我们是同样境遇的人，我已让你见证了实现的可能。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_11"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 12,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "（实现的可能……）",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_12"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 13,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "弗洛洛。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_13"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 14,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "这些雾……比之前遇到的还要浓重……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_14"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 15,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "而且……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_15"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 16,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "彼岸的情况又变差了？",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_16"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 17,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "你创造的索诺拉，似乎也和你时刻性命相连。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_17"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 18,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "敏锐的推测。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_18"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 19,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "但别担心，这不会影响我们合作的目标。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_19"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 20,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "路总会有的，跟上我。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_66_20"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 21,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "成功了。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_68_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 22,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "继续向前。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_68_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 23,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_73_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 24,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_73_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 25,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这些柱子的阻拦……",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_73_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 26,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "……好刻意。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_73_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 27,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "你看这里。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 28,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "一段曲谱？它好像和之前调律台上的那些曲谱形制一样。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 29,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "它们是同一首曲谱中的不同乐章，只有全部调律完成，整首曲子才能回归正常的曲调。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 30,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这首曲子到底有什么作用？",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_5",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_9:4",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 31,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "我之前说过，万物皆由频率构成，旋律可以改变事物原有的节奏，调律它们的本质就可以改变它们的状态。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 32,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "你的意思是我们见到的失控，都是芬莱克把这首曲子打乱造成的。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_7"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 33,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "是。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_8"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 34,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "这首乐曲是控制隐海试验场正常运转的核心，只有将它调整回去，各区域才能恢复正常，区域之间的通路才能正常打开。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_9"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 35,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "这首曲子原本出自你手。",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_10",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_9:8",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 36,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "你……记得这首曲子？",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_11"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 37,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "没印象，但不难猜，合作肯定是双向的。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_12"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 38,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_13"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 39,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "你说得没错。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_14"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 40,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "没留点后手以防万一？",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_15",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_9:12",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 41,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "如果没有，我们又怎会走到这里？",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_16"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 42,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "不过……本应在调律台上的曲谱，却被藏在了这个声骸培育舱中……",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_17"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 43,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "正好一并带过去复原。",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_18",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_9:14",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 44,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "……恐怕不会这么容易。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_74_19"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 45,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "去那。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "CommonVoice_Fuluoluo_3_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 46,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "完全混乱了……",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_70_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 47,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "蓄能中枢存储着大量能源，这里的一切都更容易被影响。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_70_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 48,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "蓄能中枢……听起来是维持这里运转的关键一环。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_70_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 49,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "没错。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_70_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 50,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "这里需要调律。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "CommonVoice_Fuluoluo_4_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 51,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "果然……还缺失了两段曲谱，真是拙劣的手段。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_75_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 52,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "刚才所过之处只有那一个。",
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_75_2",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_2_5_隐海试验场_能源场上层_1_10:1",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 53,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "那么，只剩一种可能。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_75_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 54,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "弗洛洛",
                  "text": "剩余的两段，都在我们脚下。",
                  "speaker_id": 560,
                  "text_id": "Main_Linaxita_2_7_75_4"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "source_chapter": "黎那汐塔 第二章",
          "source_act_id": 18
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
